report/
# Local evaluation output; the real result CSVs live in the dataset (see
# below), not in this repo.
modes/*/mode*_results/
# The dataset (images, candidate pools, per-mode question sets, and result
# CSVs) is not committed to this repo; it lives on Hugging Face
# (HassanB4/sarab). Scripts resolve it via SARAB_DATA_DIR, a sibling
# Sarab-Dataset-HF/ checkout, or an automatic Hub download. If you point
# SARAB_DATA_DIR at a directory inside this repo for local development,
# ignore it here too:
/Sarab-Dataset-HF/
